<title>USA: Famous Dave's IPO offering priced.</title>
<headline>Famous Dave's IPO offering priced.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Famous Dave's of America Inc said Monday its initial 2.3 million unit offering was declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission and priced at $6.50 per unit.</p>
<p>Each unit consists of one share of common stock and one redeemable Class A warrant.</p>
<p>Shares of the barbecue restaurant company were trading at 11-7/8, up 5-3/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
